OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATroubles legacy plan a backwards
OL,4,Astep, says former senior prosecutor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former director of public
OL,7,Fprosecutions (DPP) in Northern Ireland
OL,8,Fhas accused the government of running
OL,9,F"coach and horses" through the
OL,10,Findependence of the office.
OL,12,FBarra McGrory KC SC said a plan by the
OL,13,Fgovernment to give the attorney general
OL,14,Ffor England and Wales the final say in
OL,15,FTroubles-related prosecutions in
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland was a "significant
OL,17,Fbackward step".
OL,19,FHe said had the proposed arrangement
OL,20,Fbeen in place when he was first
OL,21,Fappointed, he would not have applied
OL,22,Ffor the job.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
