OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland Office said the
OL,7,Fattorney general was also the advocate
OL,8,Fgeneral for Northern Ireland, and the
OL,9,Fplan was a recommendation from
OL,10,FParliament's Joint Committee on Human
OL,11,FRights.
